+---
+id: ex-aqft-two-group-postnikov-background
+kind: example
+title: A nonzero finite Postnikov cocycle background
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+dependency_level: 1
+deps:
+  - def-aqft-two-group-background
+dependency_roles:
+  def-aqft-two-group-background: mathematical-premise
